WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.639 --> 00:00:08.120
It is easy to sit back and let others control
and influence our lives.

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:13.440
To give up and accept life’s conditions
as they are handed to us, without questioning

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.799
or selecting them.

00:00:15.799 --> 00:00:20.279
But as humans, we have the profound ability
to choose.

00:00:20.279 --> 00:00:29.039
The ability to examine, consider, and select
or deselect how we wish to live and see things.

00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:35.870
If you sit submissive and choose to not choose
in life, you give others the ability to choose

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.300
for you.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:42.460
You lose control of your unique psychological
world.

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:47.969
There are as many psychological worlds as
there are people within this one physical

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:49.629
world.

00:00:49.629 --> 00:00:57.320
A psychological world is the objective world,
as a particular consciousness perceives and

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.300
experiences it.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:08.729
It is the sum of a person’s genetic dispositions,
conditioned behaviors, and experiences, developing

00:01:08.729 --> 00:01:12.490
into one unique vantage point.

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:19.640
As a result, 7 billion people experience a
slightly different color of the same world.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:25.360
And every person experiences a slightly different
color of you.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:29.689
People see you in the ways that fit their
own world.

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:32.680
And you do the same for them.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:40.090
This is ok, though, because one can maintain
their own world while also existing in others.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:46.719
What we must careful of, though, is losing
control of our own world in the process.

00:01:46.719 --> 00:01:55.460
It is ok to inspire or be inspired by those
we encounter in life, but it is damaging to

00:01:55.460 --> 00:02:01.549
completely accept all the versions of the
world that other people see.

00:02:01.549 --> 00:02:09.340
When we do this, we accept everyone’s color
as our own and become a mix of TOO many colors,

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:13.489
all blending into a murky neutral brown.

00:02:13.489 --> 00:02:20.570
Instead, we must be selective and conscious
of the colors we let our own mix with.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:26.590
We must maintain a unique and beautiful color
that is distinctive and self-righteous.

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:34.780
The best way to accomplish this is by realizing
that your version of the world is not all

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.560
there is.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:41.980
If your color is unique, than so must everyone
else’s.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:47.760
When we realize this, we no longer feel the
need for our color to match with everyone

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:48.760
else’s.

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:55.360
We cease trying to absorb other peoples’
and other people’s will no longer be able

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:59.100
to passively absorb ours.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:06.519
Only when we admit that the world exists in
seven billion different forms, can we begin

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:19.669
to focus on controlling our own.

